    </p>
  </header>
  <WorkList />
  <div class="page-endnote">
    <p>My research lives in the open, too.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/publications/">
      Publications and open-source work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </div>
